{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0166tsPHD8Ruwp3eEXtbNJqt","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Thursday standup — 2026-09-04\n2\t\n3\tKicked off with Priya on the migration.\n4\tShe's blocked on the seed data — needs the sanitized dump by Monday.\n5\tRafael flagged the search endpoint latency again; p95 is 480ms, target is 200.\n6\tHe'll write it up in a doc by Friday.\n7\tPriya asked if we're still shipping the reminder emails this quarter.\n8\tNobody had a good answer. I said I'd get back to her.\n9\tMarketing wants a copy freeze on the landing page by 2026-09-15.\n10\tI need to send Priya the dump before Monday, and get Rafael a review slot.\n11\tAlso — the retro is next Tuesday; find a room.\n12\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e2eb0ab-848e-474e-abc8-03ebdb494df0","uuid":"eec693c6-057a-42f6-86ac-48039a97f8e0","timestamp":"2026-09-09T15:17:15.618Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/bear/Documents/CoWork/bear-textbooks/books/anthropics/claude-code-101/00-what-it-is/cc-claude-101/scratch/notes.md","content":"# Thursday standup — 2026-09-04\n\nKicked off with Priya on the migration.\nShe's blocked on the seed data — needs the sanitized dump by Monday.\nRafael flagged the search endpoint latency again; p95 is 480ms, target is 200.\nHe'll write it up in a doc by Friday.\nPriya asked if we're still shipping the reminder emails this quarter.\nNobody had a good answer. I said I'd get back to her.\nMarketing wants a copy freeze on the landing page by 2026-09-15.\nI need to send Priya the dump before Monday, and get Rafael a review slot.\nAlso — the retro is next Tuesday; find a room.\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}}}
